    {
      "id": "vKEsyHFk/qKGcB6vZ#05IbJcd0",
      "title": "The workhorse's news arrives at once",
      "narrative": "A workhorse turn that ends or begins waiting on the user, whoever started it, and anything the workhorse says through tell_coordinator become one sentence of workhorse news that names the checkout of the workhorse. It goes out as one turn/start, which Codex adds to the coordinator's running turn or starts a turn with, so nothing waits for the coordinator to be idle and nothing enters its history without a turn that acts on it. What it answers under [FINAL] is spoken; a [COMMENTARY] line stays quiet.",
